//!   port matches the reference binary on stdout, stderr and exit status alike.
//!
//! The binary (`test5.rs`) deliberately does *not* depend on this library: it
//! pulls the same module files in with `#[path]` declarations so that
//! `rustc -O test5.rs` works with no dependency resolution at all. This crate
